V1 in 0 SINE(0 1 1k) AC 1
R1 N001 in 10k
R2 out N001 50k
X§X1 N001 0 out opamp Aol=100K GBW=10Meg ;§pnba invin)noninvin)out
.tran 0 3m 0 1u
